          %p More abstractly, this construction is described as follows. Recall that
          .num_defn
            %h6#definition_5 Definition
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplex+category"} simplex category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
