              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
              on non-empty finite
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+orders"} linear orders
              regarded as categories, meaning that the object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
