          %h2#references References
          %h3#for_covers For covers
          %p
            The notion of the nerve of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cover"} cover
            (in modern parlance: of its
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cech+groupoid"} Cech groupoid
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Alexandroff"}> Paul Alexandroff
              , Section 9 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Über den allgemeinen Dimensionsbegriff und seine Beziehungen zur elementaren geometrischen Anschauung
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01451612"} doi:10.1007/BF01451612
          %h3#for_categories For categories
          %p The notion of the nerve of a general category already appears in
          %ul
            %li#Grothendieck61
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Grothendieck"}> Alexander Grothendieck
              , above Proposition 4.1 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Techniques de construction et théorèmes d’existence en géométrie algébrique III : préschémas quotients
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/?id=SB_1960-1961__6__99_0"} numdam:SB_1960-1961__6__99_0
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/SB_1960-1961__6__99_0.pdf"} pdf
          %p Another early appearance in print is:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Graeme+Segal"}> Graeme Segal
                , Section 2 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classifying spaces and spectral sequences
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/PMIHES_1968__34__105_0/"} numdam:PMIHES_1968__34__105_0
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (in the context of constructing
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+spaces"} classifying spaces
                  for
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principal+bundles"} principal bundles
                  in
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
          %p Review and exposition:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Saunders+MacLane"}> Saunders MacLane
                , §XII.2 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categories+for+the+Working+Mathematician"} Categories for the Working Mathematician
                %strong 5
                Springer (second ed. 1997) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8"}> doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kerodon"}> Kerodon
                ,
                %em The Nerve of a Category
                (
                %a{:href => "https://kerodon.net/tag/002L"}> 002L
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kerodon"}> Kerodon
                ,
                %em The Nerve of a Groupoid
                (
                %a{:href => "https://kerodon.net/tag/0035"}> 0035
                )
            %li#Rezk22
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Rezk"}> Charles Rezk
                , Part 1 of:
                %em Introduction to quasicategories
                (2022) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://faculty.math.illinois.edu/~rezk/quasicats.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Rezk-IntroToQuasicategories.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Leinster"}> Tom Leinster
                , p. 117 onwards in:
                %em Higher operads, higher categories
                , London Mathematical Society Lecture Note Series, 298. Cambridge Univ. Press 2004. xiv+433 pp. ISBN: 0-521-53215-9 (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0305049"}> arXiv:math.CT/0305049
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Leinster"}> Tom Leinster
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "https://golem.ph.utexas.edu/category/2008/01/mark_weber_on_nerves_of_catego.html"} How I learned to love the nerve construction
                = succeed "-Category" do
